abstract: >-
  Bilingual (English and Chinese) mathematical monographs (6 full-text vector PDFs
  and 6 Markdown volumes) and zero-dependency verification suites for (1) the
  17,374,215-line Generalized Riemann Hypothesis (GRH) Lean 4 formalization, (2)
  the 13,004,119-line Fermat's Last Theorem (FLT) Lean 4 formalization, and (3)
  the co-author's 79-page Navier-Stokes finite-time blow-up paper.
